title Home Assistant 0.3.0: what the deck does not draw: unsupported cards greyed "Not supported on this screen" (a thermostat, a custom card, a history graph), unsupported rows greyed by name, an icon-only view's tab, an entity Home Assistant does not have ("Not available"), a panel view with a map
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO dash-mixed

wait 1800
shot mixed-overview
check mixed-overview
expect text "Not supported on this screen"
@1280x800,800x1280,480x800 expect text "Restart router"
expect text "Overview"
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 400
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 500
shot mixed-overview-end
check mixed-overview-end
key pgdn
wait 900
shot mixed-icon-view
check mixed-icon-view
expect text "Not available"
key pgdn
wait 900
shot mixed-map
check mixed-map
expect text "Map"
expect text "Not supported on this screen"
expect noquit
